{"id":"b8cee4782e05afaeb9647efdb8858554490feba5","results":[{"path":"paper.txt","score":0.5746776,"view":{"end_line":59,"path":"paper.txt","start_line":55,"text":"Given our taxonomy of fine-grained dialogue acts that expands upon previous work, we set out to gather annotations for Twitter customer service conversations.

